Notes: Edit sources.json only (adapters: wdc-annual-means, wdc-survey, csv), then fog fetch mag-obs,
  fog lock mag-obs, fog build mag-obs, node scripts/fit_mag_obs.mjs. raw/annual_means.html is the
  WDC form (the list of observatories) as fetched on 2026-10-14; it reproduces the 2026-09-28 build
  exactly (KLI listed but not fetched, HON fetched but no longer listed).

Written by `fog build explain` from data/mag/dataset.json and data/mag/inputs.lock: edit those, not this file.
